START

Create a string variable for user input

Ask the user to enter information

Open CSC450_CT5_mod5.txt in append mode

IF the file cannot be opened
    Display an error message
    End program
END IF

Write the user's information to the file

Close the file

Open CSC450_CT5_mod5.txt for reading

Read all characters from the file

Store the characters in a string

Close the file

Reverse all characters in the string

Open CSC450-mod5-reverse.txt for writing

Write the reversed characters to the new file

Close the reversed file

Display a success message

END
